direction", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "line 83", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "eslint.config.mjs enforces domain never imports db/integrations/files/runtime, and apps/web only imports @extrawork/contracts; tests/testkit/scripts/cli are exempt."}, {"id": "claude_md_money_invariant", "label": "Money is never a float", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "line 87", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Integer paise as bigint end-to-end; lint hard-errors on parseFloat/Math.round in domain/application/db in favor of parseQuantity and roundHalfUpToBigint."}, {"id": "claude_md_frozen_snapshot_invariant", "label": "Sent version is frozen", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "line 88", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sending builds a canonical JSON snapshot (RFC 8785/JCS), SHA-256 hashes it, and stores it permanently; edits create version n+1 and revoke the old token rather than mutating."}, {"id": "claude_md_atomic_decisions_invariant", "label": "Decisions are atomic and idempotent", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "line 89", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Decision + audit events + projection update + outbox event commit in one transaction; unique constraint limits one decision per version, races resolve to 409 ALREADY_DECIDED."}, {"id": "claude_md_transactional_outbox_invariant", "label": "No provider call inside a transaction", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "line 90", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "All side effects (WhatsApp, email, PDF) go through a transactional outbox + Postgres job queue (FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED, leases, backoff, dead-letter) consumed by apps/worker."}, {"id": "claude_md_append_only_evidence_invariant", "label": "Evidence is append-only", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "line 91", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "audit_events and decisions are protected by DB triggers and revoked UPDATE/DELETE privileges; corrections only via the audited pnpm db:repair command."}, {"id": "claude_md_whatsapp_delivery_limitation", "label": "WhatsApp delivery is manual/deferred", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "line 92", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Contractor sends the link from their own number; system records SHARE_INTENT_OPENED, never 'delivered'. Cloud API auto-send and A2 e-signature exist as adapters but are not wired to a real provider."}, {"id": "claude_md_assurance_levels", "label": "Assurance levels A0/A1/A2", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "line 93", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Exact legal wording lives in packages/contracts/src/assurance.ts and is frozen into each snapshot as termsVersion; A2 is explicitly rejected, never silently downgraded."}, {"id": "claude_md_tenant_context", "label": "TenantContext / TransactionContext", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "line 94", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Highest-fan-out abstractions; nearly every repository method takes one, so an unscoped repository method is very likely a tenant-isolation bug."}, {"id": "claude_md_config_secrets_validation", "label": "Boot-time config/secret validation", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "line 98", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "packages/config refuses to start with APP_ENV=production if secrets are dev placeholders, storage driver is local, email can't deliver, or DB TLS is off."}, {"id": "claude_md_packages_contracts", "label": "packages/contracts", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "line 70", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_md_packages_domain", "label": "packages/domain", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "line 71", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_md_packages_db", "label": "packages/db", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "line 72", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_md_packages_application", "label": "packages/application", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "line 73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_md_packages_integrations", "label": "packages/integrations", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "line 74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_md_packages_files", "label": "packages/files", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "line 75", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_md_packages_runtime", "label": "packages/runtime", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "line 76", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_md_packages_observability", "label": "packages/observability", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "line 77", "source_url": null, "captur